ind":"announcement","title":"Demo updated for Next Fest","summary":"The Plasma Sky demo has been updated for Next Fest week. Most of what changed came straight out of the feedback thread, so thank you for posting. Here's the list!CONTROLSRESTART is on the pause menu now, right above RESUME. On a controller, tap SELECT (the View button on Steam Deck) twice to restart a run on the spot.D-pad and keyboard movement starts at full speed on the first frame. The startup inertia is gone.At max sensitivity the right shoulder button and trigger work as SLOW, the same as t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:28:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027000","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:54:38Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951340-1845383656386501","game_id":"steam-4951340","kind":"announcement","title":"Plasma Sky DEMO out NOW","summary":"The Plasma Sky demo is live and free to play! Grab it here: WHAT'S IN THE DEMO - A 20-level sample of Conquest, picked from across the full game's 100-level campaign - The complete weekly Challenge mode, nothing held back - Live leaderboards, so you can race your friends and everyone else - Steam Deck support, including rotated TATE play CHALLENGE MODE Every week there's a new seeded run, the same enemies and the same drops for every player. It's a set of levels you can finish in five minutes if","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T14:21:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951340-1841579228676742","game_id":"steam-4951340","kind":"announcement","title":"Plasma Sky on Steam Deck","summary":"The official review and badge may take a while to show up, but I love playing games on Steam Deck so I've made sure Plasma Sky runs great.Steam Deck related features:Full controller supportReadable text sizesNo settings tweaks needed, runs at 1300 FPS uncapped(Don't play uncapped, enjoy the long battery life at 60!)Dedicated STEAM DECK rotation mode for those who like portable TATESteam Cloud savesScore submission handles spotty internetPlasma Sky will get the Verified badge as soon as it's avai","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T22:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676742","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4951340-1841579228676684","game_id":"steam-4951340","kind":"announcement","title":"Plasma Sky returns!","summary":"Hi all!I'm so stoked to revive and upgrade Plasma Sky so that more people can play it. I finished the first version of the game in 2013 just after finishing work on Torchlight 2 at Runic. I made a lot of it while on my bus commute! Even after spending a billion hours (estimate) testing and tuning the game, I still really enjoy playing it and get sucked in longer than intended, so it must be pretty good.I'm especially excited about the new challenge mode that arranges levels every week for a shor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T21:28:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228676684","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:12:41Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4951340":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:41Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:33:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4951340":"2026-10-26T05:33:41Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4951340":{"last_attemp